#adm/daemons/mailmesg.c
remain ({"tsunami",})
mesg "Title: about quests in island..From:  TsunamiDate:  Thu Sep 19    Dear gods:      island的四个quest名称,过程,及经验值设定如下:    1. (\"save_tree\") in island/forest:      在aiga处ask aiga about sadness->在枯\木/d/island/forest/area/way5.c      处pray seed->在御花园/d/island/forest/city/garden1.c处把种子给gardener      ->在aiga处/d/island/forest/city/inhouse1.c 要report fine.      经验值 1000.    2. (\"find_luoky\") in island/forest:      在sasami处/d/island/forest/city/inhouse3.c ask sasami about luoky      ->在农场/d/island/forest/city/farm4.c处向wife要萝卜radish->回御花园      /d/island/forest/city/garden1.c 把萝卜给luoky give radish to luoky->回sasami处将水晶给sasami.      经验值100.      错了,1000.      3. 在龙门客栈/d/island/town/hotel.c中ask valor about trouble->       help valor->在/d/island/hole/hole45.c ask leader about valor->       去东北角看过之後回报leader, report vampire to leader->       在/d/island/hole/hole43.c问poutiff, ask poutiff about vampire->       在/d/island/6,10.island.c问锯木工人,ask sawyer about mahogany->       再问ask sawyer about tool->在/d/island/hole/hole28.c, ask ol->去砍大白鲨拿鱼翅->把鱼翅给龙门客栈老板/d/island/town/hotel.c, give fin to boss->把鱼翅汤给老木匠/d/island/hole/hole28.c, give soup to feller->       拿锯子到/d/island/5,4.island.c锯桃木(指令忘了)->把桃木给/d/island/town/      i_place.c的lady->把桃木剑给/d/island/hole/hole43的poutiff->到水晶池      (应该在/d/island/hole/hole24吧.)喝水->去/d/island/hole/hole1x.c(忘了)      show amethyst to vampire->用桃木剑射vampire,然後等他死.      经验值 50000      reason: 具ishige的说法, 关键的leader及poutiff都一天一只,加上很多hint并不明显,      so , give the player lots exp.    the name of the quest is (\"vampire\") in island/hole      4. (\"nakoruru\") in island/samurai     到nakoruru处问calford->到calford处问nakoruru->到uyko处要雕像->     把雕像给nakoruru.     (sorry,地方忘了,测试时只要clone这三只monster就可....:P)      经验值 1500.     以上, 是island的quest,解法及经验设定, 我不能用questd使这些任务合法化     , 请哪位大神帮个忙, 设定一下, 一切就ok了, 谢谢!!^_^    Best Regards,                                                 Tsunami"
